🚀 Step 3: Update Database Sequences (SQL)
Since we changed allocationSize to 50 in Java, we MUST update the sequences in Oracle to increment by 50. If we don't, you will get "Unique Constraint" errors.
Run this in your SQL Developer:
-- 1. Update Journal Request Sequence
ALTER SEQUENCE "FTWOAHM"."JOURNAL_REQUEST_SEQ" INCREMENT BY 50;

-- 2. Update GL Transaction Sequence
ALTER SEQUENCE "FTWOAHM"."GL_TRANSACTIONS_SEQ" INCREMENT BY 50;

-- 3. Update Master Journal Sequence (If used heavily)
ALTER SEQUENCE "FTWOAHM"."MASTER_JOURNAL_SEQ" INCREMENT BY 50;

